      "header": "Rework notes",
      "question": "When you answer `rework` at an approval, module 8 says the run goes back \"with your notes as feedback\". Today the engine routes the run back but throws your notes away (I confirmed this with a test: the stage's feedback folder stays empty). How should the notes reach the stage? (Proposed ADR `2026-11-22-human-rework-notes-reach-the-stage`)",
